    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "Hello, \r\n\r\nI have found your mini.jump to be a great alternative to other plugins of its type. \r\n\r\nIn the doc, there are two functions: `MiniJump.on_cursormoved()` and `MiniJump.stop_jumping()` that I want to apply together. \r\nBasically, I want mini-jump to prompt for a new search on cursor moved, are there any working example for this functionality? I tried, but there was very little code in the doc to start with. \r\n\r\nIn addition, is there any way to implement a prev-search `prev_jump = ','`?\r\n\r\nThank you again for the great plugin.\r\n",
