            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "Thank you for replying so quickly,\r\n\r\nI didn't realize you could use 'f' to jump the next match. That was great to learn. I think I will be able to think of another keybinding to use instead of ';'. \r\n\r\nI will mark this as closed, as that is a solution to the problem I had.\r\n",
